+
+### Startup image asset
+
+Key `0x2000` contains an optional 64 × 64 four-shade image for
+`CONFIG_SPLASH_IMAGE`. It is 1,024 bytes, in row order, with four pixels
+per byte, most significant pair first. Pixel values 0 through 3 range from
+the current theme background to its foreground. The reader uses the normal
+startup screen when the record is absent or a different length. This asset
+also appears in the startup screen preview. Diagnostics and firmware update
+screens retain their own banners. The editor stores or removes it with the
+rest of the settings area, preserving unrelated entries.
